   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb n="1" xml:id="pb-1r-trl"/> <!-- Add later facs="khalili:UNKNOWN" -->
            <ab xml:id="MP6003_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>MN <persName ref="people:Kha001">whlʾm</persName> ʿL
                  MRḤ(?)<damage extent="unclear"/>
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>ẔY pdkˈ hnblkˈ LK Ẕ<unclear reason="illegible">Y</unclear>
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>MN hʾlhʾnkˈ ẔY ʾw<unclear reason="illegible">c</unclear>
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/><placeName>gndlyh</placeName> ʿL <persName ref="people:Kha001">wʾhlʾm</persName>
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/><pc>○</pc>
               <persName ref="people:Kha002">mzdkˈ</persName>
               <pc>○</pc>
               <persName ref="people:Kha003">wlkpʾṭˈ</persName>
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/><pc>○</pc> ʾšṭʾṭkˈ ẔY MN <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>pnc ʾndkˈ ẔY <placeName>lcyšṭ</placeName> <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>W ẔY-šn YNSḆWNtny <lb n="9" xml:id="trl-p1-l9"/>ckˈ <persName ref="people:Kha004">kwʾṭ</persName> YḤYṬYWNṭ <lb n="10" xml:id="trl-p1-l10"/>ʾYK-ṭ hngʾlšnˈ <lb n="11" xml:id="trl-p1-l11"/>dšnˈ
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP6003_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>az <persName ref="people:Kha001">Wahrām</persName> ō
                  xwadāy<damage extent="unclear"/>
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>ī palag hambārag tō <unclear reason="illegible">ī</unclear>
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>az xār-xānag ī Ō<unclear reason="illegible">z</unclear>
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/><placeName>γandarīg</placeName> ō <persName ref="people:Kha001">Wahrām</persName>
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/><pc>○</pc>
               <persName ref="people:Kha002">Mazdag</persName>
               <pc>○</pc>
               <persName ref="people:Kha003">Wirgbad</persName>
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/><pc>○</pc> Aštādag ī az <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>panǰ andag ī <placeName>*Razišt</placeName> <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>ud ī-šān stānēnd <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>čak <persName ref="people:Kha004">Kawād</persName> āwurd <lb n="10" xml:id="trc-p1-l10"/>kū-t hangārišn <lb n="11" xml:id="trc-p1-l11"/>dašn
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP6003_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>From Wahrām to you, lord, 
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>the storekeeper of the estate, who are 
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>from the ruling house, namely Ōz, 
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>γandarīg (inhabitant of Gandar), to Wahrām, 
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p1-l5"/>Mazdag, Wirgbād(?), 
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p1-l6"/>(and) Aštādag(?), who (are) from 
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>the five sub-districts of *Razišt.
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trans-p1-l8"/> And (as for that) which they should take for them, 
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trans-p1-l9"/>Kawād has brought the čak (document) 
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trans-p1-l10"/>so that you (sg.) should consider (the matter) 
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trans-p1-l11"/>rightly (so that you should give your consent).
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>